<figure id="S4.T6" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Tool usage frequency (%) across agent configurations.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<table id="S4.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_middle">
