<p id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Parameters</span>:</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">path</span> (string, required): The path of the directory to list.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i6.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">ignore</span> (array, optional): A list of glob patterns to exclude from results.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A4.I2.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"> 
<div id="A4.I2.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.I2.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7. <span id="A4.I2.i7.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">search_google</span></span>
Performs a Google search to find solutions for build errors or other issues.</p>
