<p id="A4.I2.i7.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I2.i7.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">query</span> (string, required): The search query, typically an error message.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
